WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Review the recipient, amount and fee.
Demo balances and addresses only.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.800
Release an incomplete slide.
The handle returns. Nothing is sent.

00:07.800 --> 00:10.000
Ready? Start another slide.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.800
Slide toward the end of the track.

00:12.800 --> 00:14.600
Holding at the end does not send.
You can still move back before release.

00:14.600 --> 00:15.800
Release at 90% or more to continue.
The checkmark acknowledges the gesture.

00:15.800 --> 00:18.000
Submission begins after the sheet closes.
This demonstration does not move funds.

00:18.000 --> 00:20.000
Confirming is different from confirmed.

00:20.000 --> 00:22.639
The same capsule updates to Confirmed.
Confirmation timing is simulated.
